{
  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8",
  "title": "【陈攀 Span】Al SaaS 出海 SEO:  那些最有效的网站页面策略",
  "author": "哥飞",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "高手分享"
  ],
  "content": "<div>本文来自于 陈攀 Span 2024年7月12日在线性资本AI分享会中的分享内容，哥飞获得授权后分享给哥飞的朋友们。</div>\n<div>演示文件：<a href=\"https://gamma.app/docs/-cw5qlooa3u9n9fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://gamma.app/docs/-cw5qlooa3u9n9fa</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img1.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>陈攀 Span 是前出海SaaS 公司Notta.ai SEO 负责人，带领团队2年时间内将网站月自然搜索流量做到1M。他具有7 年互联网产品经理经验和4年 Google SEO 经验。</div>\n<div>同时，陈攀 Span 也是哥飞的朋友们社群成员之一。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img2.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">分享内容</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>从漏斗底部的关键词开始创建内容</li>\n<li>打造内容层级结构</li>\n<li>看别人的模式找自己的方法 -  如何打造落地页</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">1. 从漏斗底部（BOTU）的关键词词开始创建内容</h2>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img3.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>Top of the funnel (TOFU) – Awareness.</div>\n<div>漏斗顶部（TOFU）——意识。</div>\n<div>Middle of the funnel (MOFU) – Interest.</div>\n<div>漏斗中部（MOFU）——兴趣。</div>\n<div>Bottom of the funnel (BOFU) – Desire and Action.</div>\n<div>漏斗底部（BOFU）——渴望和行动。</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">1.1 漏斗底部的词有着明确的问题待解决/产品需求，它们有更高的转化率。</h3>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img4.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">1.2 例如，对转写产品关键词归类：</h3>\n<table><thead><tr><th>分类</th><th>关键词列表</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>漏斗顶部的关键词（TOFU）</td><td>virtual meeting etiquette, zoom bible study, extract audio from video, types of meetings……</td></tr><tr><td>漏斗中部的关键词（MOFU）</td><td>how to record a webex meeting, how to improve typing speed, best chrome extenstion, preparing for a meeting……</td></tr><tr><td>漏斗底部的关键词（BOFU）</td><td>best transcription software, mp3 to text, how to transcribe a zoom meeting, otter alternatives……</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">2. 打造内容层级结构</h2>\n<div>好的内容层级结构具有以下好处：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>对用户体验友好</li>\n<li>对搜索引擎爬虫友好</li>\n<li>对建立 Topical Authority 友好</li>\n</ul>\n<div>以一个菜谱网站为例，内容层级结构可能是下面这样的：</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img5.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">2.1 只要层级清晰对用户体验友好，不用担心层级太深影响页面权重</h3>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img6.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">2.2 更丰富的页面信息架构：</h3>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img7.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">2.3 以一个做 virtual graphic  的 SaaS 产品为例：</h3>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img8.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">2.4 我们发现 Mind Map 话题相关的内容出现在各个板块：</h3>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img9.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">2.5 打造好内链网络</h3>\n<div>让低级别的页面向上链接；让重要页面获得更多内链</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img10.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">3. 如何打造落地页 (Landing Page)</h2>\n<div>SaaS产品承载SEO目的核心落地页类型：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>变体词落地页</li>\n<li>竞品对比页</li>\n<li>功能介绍页</li>\n<li>相关小工具页</li>\n<li>模板页</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">3.1 变体词落地页</h3>\n<div>方法：确定你产品的主关键词，找出所有的同义词/近义词/搜索意图相同的词，并为每个关键词建立单独的页面。</div>\n<div>例如，主关键词为 speech to text，可以做这些变体词落地页:</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img11.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<table><thead><tr><th>关键词</th><th>落地页</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Mp3 to text</td><td><a href=\"https://www.notta.ai/en/mp3-to-text\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.notta.ai/en/mp3-to-text</a></td></tr><tr><td>Mp4 to text</td><td><a href=\"https://www.notta.ai/en/mp4-to-text\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.notta.ai/en/mp4-to-text</a></td></tr><tr><td>YouTube to text</td><td><a href=\"https://www.notta.ai/en/youtube-to-text\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.notta.ai/en/youtube-to-text</a></td></tr><tr><td>Audio to text</td><td><a href=\"https://www.notta.ai/en/audio-to-text\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.notta.ai/en/audio-to-text</a></td></tr><tr><td>Video to text</td><td><a href=\"https://www.notta.ai/en/video-to-text\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.notta.ai/en/video-to-text</a></td></tr><tr><td>Spanish audio to text</td><td><a href=\"https://www.notta.ai/en/spanish-audio-to-text\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.notta.ai/en/spanish-audio-to-text</a></td></tr><tr><td>French audio to text</td><td><a href=\"https://www.notta.ai/en/french-audio-to-text\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.notta.ai/en/french-audio-to-text</a></td></tr><tr><td>Audio file to text</td><td><a href=\"https://www.notta.ai/en/audio-file-to-text\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.notta.ai/en/audio-file-to-text</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">3.2 竞品对比页</h3>\n<div>方法：找出产品的所有竞品，将竞品品牌词组合 alternatives / competitors / like / vs，为有搜索量的关键词建立单独的页面。</div>\n<div>例如，HubSpot 作为一个 CMS 软件，做了竞品对比落地页:</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img12.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<table><thead><tr><th>关键词</th><th>落地页</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Salesforce vs HubSpot</td><td><a href=\"https://www.hubspot.com/comparisons/salesforce-vs-hubspot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.hubspot.com/comparisons/salesforce-vs-hubspot</a></td></tr><tr><td>HubSpot vs Pipedrive</td><td><a href=\"https://www.hubspot.com/comparisons/pipedrive-vs-hubspot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.hubspot.com/comparisons/pipedrive-vs-hubspot</a></td></tr><tr><td>Marketo vs HubSpot</td><td><a href=\"https://www.hubspot.com/comparisons/marketo-vs-hubspot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.hubspot.com/comparisons/marketo-vs-hubspot</a></td></tr><tr><td>Pardot vs HubSpot</td><td><a href=\"https://www.hubspot.com/comparisons/pardot-vs-hubspot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.hubspot.com/comparisons/pardot-vs-hubspot</a></td></tr><tr><td>Mailchimp vs HubSpot</td><td><a href=\"https://www.hubspot.com/comparisons/mailchimp-vs-hubspot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.hubspot.com/comparisons/mailchimp-vs-hubspot</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">3.3 功能介绍页</h3>\n<div>方法：找出产品每一个功能点对应的关键词，并为每个关键词词建立单独的页面。</div>\n<div>例如，VEED 作为一个视频编辑软件，他把这样的小功能都做了落地页:</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img13.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<table><thead><tr><th>关键词</th><th>落地页</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Add Image to Video</td><td><a href=\"https://www.veed.io/tools/add-photo-to-video\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.veed.io/tools/add-photo-to-video</a></td></tr><tr><td>Add Music to Video</td><td><a href=\"https://www.veed.io/tools/add-audio-to-video\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.veed.io/tools/add-audio-to-video</a></td></tr><tr><td>Add Text to Video</td><td><a href=\"https://www.veed.io/tools/add-text-to-video\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.veed.io/tools/add-text-to-video</a></td></tr><tr><td>Music Visualizer</td><td><a href=\"https://www.veed.io/tools/music-visualizer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.veed.io/tools/music-visualizer</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">3.4 相关小工具页</h3>\n<div>方法：拆分产品功能，将它做成1个/多个可在线体验的在线工具。</div>\n<div>例如，Ahrefs 作为一款 SEO 分析工具，他提供了这样的在线免费工具：</div>\n<table><thead><tr><th>关键词</th><th>落地页</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Website “Authority” Checker</td><td><a href=\"https://ahrefs.com/website-authority-checker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://ahrefs.com/website-authority-checker</a></td></tr><tr><td>Backlink Checker</td><td><a href=\"https://ahrefs.com/backlink-checker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://ahrefs.com/backlink-checker</a></td></tr><tr><td>Broken Link Checker</td><td><a href=\"https://ahrefs.com/broken-link-checker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://ahrefs.com/broken-link-checker</a></td></tr><tr><td>YouTube Keyword Tool</td><td><a href=\"https://ahrefs.com/youtube-keyword-tool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://ahrefs.com/youtube-keyword-tool</a></td></tr><tr><td>Website Checker</td><td><a href=\"https://ahrefs.com/website-checker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://ahrefs.com/website-checker</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img14.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">3.5 模板页</h3>\n<div>方法：分析产品能实现的功能，为每个有模板需求关键词建立单独的落地页。</div>\n<div>例如，Canva 作为一个图片处理软件，他把这样的模板需求都做了落地页:</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img15.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<table><thead><tr><th>关键词</th><th>落地页</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Wedding invitation templates</td><td><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/wedding-invitations/templates/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.canva.com/wedding-invitations/templates/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Phone wallpaper templates</td><td><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/phone-wallpapers/templates/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.canva.com/phone-wallpapers/templates/</a></td></tr><tr><td>LinkedIn banner templates</td><td><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/linkedin-banners/templates/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.canva.com/linkedin-banners/templates/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Business card templates</td><td><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/business-cards/templates/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.canva.com/business-cards/templates/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Invoice templates</td><td><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/invoice/templates/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.canva.com/invoice/templates/</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div>Canva不仅为模板一级分类做了落地页，对模板二级分类也都做了落地页：</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img16.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<table><thead><tr><th>关键词</th><th>落地页</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Beach wedding invitation templates</td><td><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/wedding-invitations/templates/beach/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.canva.com/wedding-invitations/templates/beach/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Winter wedding invitation templates</td><td><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/wedding-invitations/templates/winter/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.canva.com/wedding-invitations/templates/winter/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Muslim Wedding Invitations templates</td><td><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/wedding-invitations/templates/muslim/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.canva.com/wedding-invitations/templates/muslim/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Indian Wedding Invitations templates</td><td><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/wedding-invitations/templates/indian/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.canva.com/wedding-invitations/templates/indian/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Gold Wedding Invitation templates</td><td><a href=\"https://www.canva.com/wedding-invitations/templates/gold/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.canva.com/wedding-invitations/templates/gold/</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">3.6 落地页常用模块</h3>\n<h4>#1 Hero Block</h4>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img17.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>原则：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>Heading 1：明确传达用户价值，最好包括理性和感性内容</li>\n<li>Product Description：简洁明了，无流行术语，并强化标题1的价值主张</li>\n<li>Product Visual: 图像展示产品的特点；或有一个带字幕的GIF或视频展示产品工作原理</li>\n<li>明确的Call-To-Action，与Heading 1一致</li>\n<li>Hero Block 包含Social Proof，在桌面和移动设备上恰好占据一个屏幕</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>#2 产品所解决的问题 (Optional)</h4>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img18.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>原则：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>进一步说明Hero Block 的价值主张</li>\n<li>简明扼要描述你的产品正在解决的问题</li>\n<li>分点、分段落阐述产品所解决的问题</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>#3 产品 How-To Guide</h4>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img19.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>原则：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>分步描述如何使用产品，配有清晰的图片</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>#4 产品 Use Case (Optional)</h4>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img20.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>原则：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>突出产品适用的人群及对应的 use case</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>#5 产品的功能、优势</h4>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img21.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>原则：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>突出用户关心的3-4个产品功能亮点</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>#6 Testimonials</h4>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img22.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>原则：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>最好是用真实的用户评价，用用户的真实头像</li>\n<li>突出他们的观点：产品正在解决的问题、如果没使用这个产品产生的影响等</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>#7 Why Choose Us</h4>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img23.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>原则：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>阐述4-8个产品优势/亮点</li>\n</ul>\n<div>Tips:</div>\n<ul>\n<li>如果是批量建落地页，为避免页面内容重复度高，可提前梳理出12个优势点，每个优势点写3种不同的表达，不同的landing page 任意组合</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>#8 Templates &amp; Samples（适用于Templates相关落地页）</h4>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img24.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>原则：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>推荐与产品相关/相似的模板</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>#9 产品 FAQs</h4>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img25.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>原则：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>推荐写5-10个问题</li>\n<li>直接正面的回答问题</li>\n</ul>\n<div>Tips：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>FAQs 可从用户提出的实际问题选出、可从 Search SERPs 的 People Also Ask 板块选出、可参考竞争对手相同的小工具页面的 FAQs、可从 Quora/Reddit 等论坛中选出热度高的问题、可从数据分析工具Semrush(Qustions)/Ahrefs(Search Suggestions) 等查看</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>#10 Explore More</h4>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img26.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>原则：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>推荐其它相关的小工具/功能落地页/模板</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>#11 Read More (Optional)</h4>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img27.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>原则：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>增加与本页面相关的Blog/Resources</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>#12 CTA</h4>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img28.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>原则：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>简单，呼吁行动</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>其它 Tips</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>落地页展示不少于三种类型的Social Proof, 常见的Social Proof 有以下几种：</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>Brand logos</li>\n<li>Testimonials</li>\n<li>Case studies</li>\n<li>Press coverage</li>\n<li>User statistics</li>\n<li>Ratings</li>\n<li>Awards</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>一个落地页放多个CTA按钮, 同一个landing page 的 CTA 文案保持一致</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img29.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>增强用户信心的CTA 小技巧：</li>\n</ol>\n<div>按钮旁边添加文案： No credit card required</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img30.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>按钮旁边放置：Rating (xxx reviews) Platform(e.s. G2, Product Hunt)</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img31.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/9e011f83aac046dc8107a51df13e39f8_img32.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>最后再次感谢 陈攀 Span 授权哥飞分享发布本文。\n11244</div>",
